# Optional: copy to .env.local and insert your own key locally. Never commit a real key.
# Next.js also reads .env; .env.local takes precedence. Restart the server after changes.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# The server uses gemini-2.5-flash-lite only; no automatic paid-model fallback.
# Use a Google AI Studio project on the FREE tier if you require zero-cost calls.
# A model's free-tier availability does not override billing on a paid project.
# Pricing/quotas: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing#gemini-2.5-flash-lite
# No key: labelled deterministic summaries; planning still works.
# Calls are user-triggered, limited to one attempt, with a 12-second provider timeout.
# Unsupported questions never call Gemini. Credentials are never sent to the browser.
